API TokenP12 CertificateDocker with Auth <ol> <li>Get token from F5XC Console → Administration → Personal Management → Credentials</li> <li>Set environment variables:</li> </ol> <pre><code>export F5XC_API_URL="https://your-tenant.console.ves.volterra.io"
export F5XC_API_TOKEN="your-api-token"
</code></pre> <ol> <li>Download P12 from F5XC Console → Administration → Personal Management → Credentials</li> <li>Set environment variables:</li> </ol> <pre><code>export F5XC_API_URL="https://your-tenant.console.ves.volterra.io"
export F5XC_P12_BUNDLE="/absolute/path/to/certificate.p12"
export F5XC_P12_PASSWORD="your-password"
</code></pre> <p>Use Absolute Paths</p> <p>P12 certificate paths must be absolute, not relative.</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "f5xc-api": {
      "command": "docker",
      "args": [
        "run", "-i", "--rm",
        "-e", "F5XC_API_URL=https://your-tenant.console.ves.volterra.io",
        "-e", "F5XC_API_TOKEN=your-api-token",
        "ghcr.io/robinmordasiewicz/f5xc-api-mcp"
      ]
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
